         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Big data visualization. Futuristic  design of data flow. Abstract digital background with flowing particles. Abstract digital background with waves, lines and dots. Technology concept of social network, business analytics.&#xA;</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
